--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CODECS THIS PRODUCT USES BUT DOES NOT INCLUDE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Reading and writing JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, AVIF and TIFF is done by the operating
system: ImageIO and vImage on iOS, ImageDecoder and Bitmap on Android. libjpeg-turbo,
libwebp, libavif, libaom and their kin are part of those platforms rather than
libraries this project ships, so no copy of them is distributed here and no notice
for them is owed. Earlier versions of this file listed them as included, which was
not true of any build.

